      <p class="gs-pl-row__body">For Philadelphia's South Street corridor, Old City storefronts, and SEPTA transit platforms, Glass Shield is the standard specification. The film is optically clear — it does not change the appearance, tint, or visible light transmission of your glass. Graffiti Shield window film in Philadelphia is installed by our certified team on ground-floor glass, lobby windows, and any surface targeted by repeated vandalism incidents.</p>
