      <p class="gs-pl-row__body">Mirror Shield is designed for the repeated, prolonged exposure typical of high-traffic Philadelphia restroom environments. As Graffiti Shield Inc. notes, the film is "designed to resist scratching, etching, and other forms of graffiti" while "maintaining the reflective appearance of mirrors" and "prolonging their lifespan and functionality." For Old City venue operators, Passyunk Avenue restaurant owners, and SEPTA facility managers, Mirror Shield eliminates mirror replacement costs.</p>
