      <p class="gs-pl-row__body">Glass Shield Multi Layer is a revolutionary 4-layer system designed to combat graffiti damage effectively in Philadelphia properties that face frequent or ongoing vandalism. Each layer consists of a 4-mil clear anti-graffiti film precisely cut to fit your glass. When the surface incurs damage, only the affected top layer is peeled away — the remaining layers continue to protect the glass below. This adaptive approach eliminates re-installation labor between incidents.</p>
